@host = http://localhost:5091

### Model readiness (503 until loaded)
GET {{host}}/health

### Negative feedback
POST {{host}}/api/feedback/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "The room was filthy, the staff were rude and the noise kept us up all night. Never again." }

### Positive feedback
POST {{host}}/api/feedback/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Wonderful stay! Friendly staff, spotless room, great breakfast." }

### Mixed feedback
POST {{host}}/api/feedback/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Lovely location but the room was tiny and the wifi barely worked." }

### Invalid (400)
POST {{host}}/api/feedback/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "" }
